  "ruleText": "Par 303.01 Purpose. The purpose of this chapter is to establish procedures for the consideration and granting of medical parole, as established in RSA 651-A:10-a.\n\nSource. #9255, eff 9-6-08, EXPIRED: 9-6-16\n\nNew. #12158, eff 4-7-17",
